{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/b55e69c5cc8868e0db4851eaab5035d2.avif?t=1772133622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras_big/b55e69c5cc8868e0db4851eaab5035d2.webp?t=1772133622 width=1560 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><i><strong>Oblivium</strong></i> is a fast-paced spellcasting roguelike where you play as a powerful sorcerer fighting through hordes of demons using magic and quick reflexes. Inspired by action roguelikes like <i>Hades</i>, Oblivium focuses on tight, skill-based combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE ART OF COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/36a0625dedcb4ef12bf3a1a6cf854f4b.poster.avif?t=1772133622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/36a0625dedcb4ef12bf3a1a6cf854f4b.webm?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/36a0625dedcb4ef12bf3a1a6cf854f4b.mp4?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Oblivium</i> is fast, responsive, and built for player expression. Time your dodges, deflect attacks with precise parries, and use mana to power up your spells for stronger effects.  Every mechanic rewards skill and timing, letting you fight in your own style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/8ed99521ff9f0a1b5bc0d185e2ad8aaf.poster.avif?t=1772133622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/8ed99521ff9f0a1b5bc0d185e2ad8aaf.webm?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/8ed99521ff9f0a1b5bc0d185e2ad8aaf.mp4?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with a wide variety of spells, elemental combinations, and upgrades to create unique builds each run. Chain elements together for powerful reactions, discover rare synergies, and adapt your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCEND THROUGH HELL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/049596a0a4dc4cc5ea94141921c527f7.poster.avif?t=1772133622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/049596a0a4dc4cc5ea94141921c527f7.webm?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/049596a0a4dc4cc5ea94141921c527f7.mp4?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the nine circles of hell inspired by <strong>Dante\u2019s Inferno</strong>, each with its own unique environments, enemies, and challenges.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124970?t=1772133622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124970?t=1772133622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/28d1965bbec0d403f510869a700d08cca89ce60d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772133622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/28d1965bbec0d403f510869a700d08cca89ce60d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772133622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/b55e69c5cc8868e0db4851eaab5035d2.avif?t=1772133622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras_big/b55e69c5cc8868e0db4851eaab5035d2.webp?t=1772133622 width=1560 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><i><strong>Oblivium</strong></i> is a fast-paced spellcasting roguelike where you play as a powerful sorcerer fighting through hordes of demons using magic and quick reflexes. Inspired by action roguelikes like <i>Hades</i>, Oblivium focuses on tight, skill-based combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE ART OF COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/36a0625dedcb4ef12bf3a1a6cf854f4b.poster.avif?t=1772133622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/36a0625dedcb4ef12bf3a1a6cf854f4b.webm?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/36a0625dedcb4ef12bf3a1a6cf854f4b.mp4?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Oblivium</i> is fast, responsive, and built for player expression. Time your dodges, deflect attacks with precise parries, and use mana to power up your spells for stronger effects.  Every mechanic rewards skill and timing, letting you fight in your own style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/8ed99521ff9f0a1b5bc0d185e2ad8aaf.poster.avif?t=1772133622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/8ed99521ff9f0a1b5bc0d185e2ad8aaf.webm?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/8ed99521ff9f0a1b5bc0d185e2ad8aaf.mp4?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with a wide variety of spells, elemental combinations, and upgrades to create unique builds each run. Chain elements together for powerful reactions, discover rare synergies, and adapt your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCEND THROUGH HELL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/049596a0a4dc4cc5ea94141921c527f7.poster.avif?t=1772133622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/049596a0a4dc4cc5ea94141921c527f7.webm?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124970/extras/049596a0a4dc4cc5ea94141921c527f7.mp4?t=1772133622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the nine circles of hell inspired by <strong>Dante\u2019s Inferno</strong>, each with its own unique environments, enemies, and challenges.</p>","de